               genome variants and coding variants poorly covered by exome
               sequencing. Cohortwide burden testing across 57,000 genomes
               enabled the discovery of three new disease genes and 19 new
               associations. Of the genetic diagnoses that we made, 25\% had
               immediate ramifications for clinical decision making for the
